715. Ref: Deptels Amman 49 (rpted Beirut as
                    161) August 16, 1951;
                    Deptel Beirut 208, August 30;
                    Legtel Beirut 194 August 
 28;
                    Legtel Beirut 212 September 4. View urgency proceed UNRWA projects, Dept has given further cons Jordan irrigation
                    proposal contained MacDonald report published March 1951. Fact that engineering plans well advanced and presumption
                    that objectives UNRWA program wld be furthered
                    by such proj in HKJ, both lead necessity of
                    thorough examination all or part this proj for UNRWA purposes.
